unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-08T17:42:30.7599220Z      A DECISION, not a migration. No teamless unit can receive an aura under any value of `affects` (`world.stats.set` is called only in spawnChampion.ts / auraCarrier.ts), and 0 of the 86 aura-derived map abilities target friend and enemy together. Either author the first friend-and-foe aura or DELETE the member together with `AuraAffects` and the `affects === "all"` early-return in `affectsTarget`.
