unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-08T17:42:30.7603406Z      Has REAL JASS provenance — war3map.j:51731 (52-02 蹂躪編年史) and :52065 (52-002 射殺百頭) both add 'Avul' to the spell TARGET — plus the AoE form 29-03 有功夫無懦夫「統統進入無敵狀態」. Not bound yet because in the source the victim's Avul is a mechanic shield removed (:51835) before the ability's own damage lands; porting it literally would make the skill refuse its own damage. Needs an owner decision (fidelity vs. the simpler self-window), which is why the 30-day clock is the right pressure here.
